slider6:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Band 1 dynamic
slider7:-30<-60,0,0.1>-Band 1 threshold (dB)
slider8:0<-24,24,0.1>-Band 1 range (dB)
slider9:1<0,6,1{Off,Bell,Low shelf,High shelf,Notch,Low cut,High cut}>-Band 2 type
slider10:250<20,20000,1>-Band 2 frequency (Hz)
