slider27:0<-24,24,0.1>-Band 4 gain (dB)
slider28:1<0.1,30,0.01>-Band 4 Q
slider29:0<0,2,1{Stereo,Mid,Side}>-Band 4 target
slider30:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Band 4 dynamic
slider31:-30<-60,0,0.1>-Band 4 threshold (dB)
slider32:0<-24,24,0.1>-Band 4 range (dB)
